sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant MeasurementsController
participant QueryMeasurementsService
participant MeasurementRepository as IMeasurementRepository / MongoMeasurementRepository

User->>MeasurementsController: GET /measurements?stationName&tempMin&tempMax&alertOnly
MeasurementsController->>QueryMeasurementsService: execute(filters)
QueryMeasurementsService->>QueryMeasurementsService: validate tempMin <= tempMax
QueryMeasurementsService->>MeasurementRepository: findWithFilters(normalizedFilters)

alt stationName filter present
  Note over MeasurementRepository: Resolve matching station IDs from station names\nbefore loading measurements
end

MeasurementRepository-->>QueryMeasurementsService: measurements
QueryMeasurementsService-->>MeasurementsController: measurements
MeasurementsController-->>User: 200 MeasurementResponse[]
